    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rally-style racing with a grappling hook. Yes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/fe98da7042d9ed65e79b196b3766902b.poster.avif?t=1749072501\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/fe98da7042d9ed65e79b196b3766902b.webm?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/fe98da7042d9ed65e79b196b3766902b.mp4?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CAR WITH A GRAPPLING HOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your car's grappling hook on nearby buildings, pillars, towers (whatever you can find, really), to twist and turn around tight tracks, pulling amounts of G-force that make F1 look like a stroll in the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, break, turn, and<strong> grapple left or right</strong>, charging up a handy boost the longer you hold the grapple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Twist, swing, and boost.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/6d949dd11f266e97ad6535751064784d.poster.avif?t=1749072501\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/6d949dd11f266e97ad6535751064784d.webm?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/6d949dd11f266e97ad6535751064784d.mp4?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND-CRAFTED TRACKS AND ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track is made with tons of unique details and shortcuts. Well-thought-out layouts with interesting curve flow that explore the previously untapped potential of a car with a grappling hook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/a3b381ebb2cfff3e34cc839e8803f5f2.poster.avif?t=1749072501\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/a3b381ebb2cfff3e34cc839e8803f5f2.webm?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/a3b381ebb2cfff3e34cc839e8803f5f2.mp4?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT THE CLOCK, THEN BEAT YOURSELF </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main opponent in Grapple Car is<strong>\u00a0yourself!</strong> (and the people above you in the online leaderboard).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every track has 3 time goals: <strong>Bronze, Silver, and Gold</strong>. Hitting them earns upgrade points to improve your car\u2019s handling and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After beating the preset times, the player is now eligible to participate in the<strong> online leaderboard</strong>\u00a0for that track, where the best of the best race it out to find the most optimal routes and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOLO DEV PROJECT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple car is a passion project mostly developed by a single person (me), so expect bold visuals and gameplay, accompanied by a unique charm/wackiness only possible when dealing with a<strong> car with a grappling hook.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, wishlist the game and stay updated on its development! Lot's of exciting stuff is coming soon, so stay tuned \ud83d\udc40</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rally-style racing with a grappling hook. Yes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/fe98da7042d9ed65e79b196b3766902b.poster.avif?t=1749072501\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/fe98da7042d9ed65e79b196b3766902b.webm?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/fe98da7042d9ed65e79b196b3766902b.mp4?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CAR WITH A GRAPPLING HOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your car's grappling hook on nearby buildings, pillars, towers (whatever you can find, really), to twist and turn around tight tracks, pulling amounts of G-force that make F1 look like a stroll in the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, break, turn, and<strong> grapple left or right</strong>, charging up a handy boost the longer you hold the grapple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Twist, swing, and boost.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/6d949dd11f266e97ad6535751064784d.poster.avif?t=1749072501\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/6d949dd11f266e97ad6535751064784d.webm?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579900/extras/6d949dd11f266e97ad6535751064784d.mp4?t=1749072501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp