ng> car with a grappling hook.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, wishlist the game and stay updated on its development! Lot's of exciting stuff is coming soon, so stay tuned \ud83d\udc40</p>",
